          newPassword,
          page: null,
          limit: null,
        } satisfies IErpHrmTimeTrackingMemberPasswordReset.IRequest,
      },
    );
  typia.assert(updated);
  // 4) Validate response matches same member identity
  TestValidator.equals("member id unchanged", updated.id, memberId);
